      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omak%2C_Washington"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Since 2007, Omak has earned the title of Washington’s “tree city” for ten straight years, thanks to its forest stewardship.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8,
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
